        Add the new route to the existing `MapGroup("/api/compose").RequireAuthorization().WithTags("Compose")` group; follow the `.WithName/.WithSummary/.RequireRateLimiting/.Produces` convention already used by Load/Save/Promote.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + dependency check">Confirm Spike 5 (005) notes are available; read the validated write recipe. Run the rigor-level declaration (FULL). Load the knowledge files + bff-extensions.md before designing.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Add Open XML SDK packages">Add `DocumentFormat.OpenXml` 3.x + `Codeuctivity.OpenXmlPowerTools` (MIT) to `Sprk.Bff.Api.csproj`. Immediately measure publish size + CVE per ADR-029 and record the baseline delta before writing code.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Design the annotation input contract">Define the structured input the writer consumes (comments with anchor spans; insertion/deletion pairs with target text + author/date). Reuse the compose-disposition edit-payload shape where it aligns (`target_text`/`new_text`); do not invent a parallel schema. Keep the DTO in `Services/Compose/`.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Implement DocxAnnotationWriter">Open the source `.docx` with the SDK; apply comments then track-changes in the correct order. Encode each edge case as a `// EDGE-N:` numbered comment: (a) comments-before-track-changes ordering (adeu + pandoc #9833); (b) paragraph-boundary `&lt;w:del&gt;` deleting the paragraph mark via `w:pPr/w:rPr/w:del` (adeu BUG-23-3); (c) monotonic per-document revision-id + unique author/date metadata. Leave untouched runs byte-stable.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Wire the push-annotations endpoint">Add `POST /api/compose/document/{spe-id}/push-annotations` to `ComposeEndpoints.cs`: download current bytes via the facade, run the writer, persist via `ReplaceFileContentAsUserAsync` with the caller-supplied `If-Match` etag. Return the new etag/version. Handle etag-conflict (412) and malformed-DOCX (400) as ProblemDetails.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Unit tests">Author `DocxAnnotationWriterTests` in `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/Services/Compose/`: assert emitted markup for each edge case; assert byte-stability of untouched content; negative cases for malformed input and etag conflict. Mock at the SPE facade boundary (ADR-038; no `Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`).</step>
    <step order="6" name="Verify + size/CVE report">Build BFF + run the new tests. Re-run publish-size + CVE, report absolute + delta. Run the NetArchTest facade check (Services/Compose has no AI-internal injection). Update TASK-INDEX status.</step>
  </steps>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/DocxAnnotationWriter.cs</output>
